<title>SINGAPORE: NTT has stake in Singapore telcom group.</title>
<headline>NTT has stake in Singapore telcom group.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Nippon and Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) will hold about a 20 percent stake in a group bidding for a basic telecom licence in Singapore, said a senior British Telecommunications' (BT) official on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>BT's chief executive officer Peter Bonsield told reporters in Singapore that NTT would be a partner in the consortium bidding for Singapore's second basic telecoms license to be awarded in 1998.</p>
<p>Other members of the group include Singapore Technologies Telemedia and Singapore Power.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom(65-8703080)</p>
</text>
